### Validation rules

Event Booking:
- First Name: non-empty text
- Last Name: non-empty text
- Phone Number: non-empty text
- Email ID: non-empty text
- Event Type: select an option other than default "Select Event"
- Event Date: non-empty text
- Event Time: non-empty text
- Guest Count: non-empty text
- Catering: one radio option (Veg/NonVeg) must be selected
- Address: non-empty text
- City: select an option other than default "Select City"
- Pincode: non-empty text
- Event Details: provide event details; this is the only non-mandatory field

Contact Us:
- Name: non-empty text; application does not enforce letters-only
- Email: non-empty text; although type=email, there is no `<form>` wrapper, so native browser email validation does not fire on click and the script layer performs no format check
- Subject: non-empty text
- Message: non-empty text
- All 4 fields are mandatory

Application behaviour:
- Event Booking displays a confirmation message and appends submitted rows to a results table on the same page.
- Contact Us displays a brief "please wait" message followed by a delayed confirmation message.

